  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General Contribution to the Joint United Nations Programme on HIV/AIDS (UNAIDS) 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish cooperation with UNAIDS is based on an organisation strategy covering the period 2017-2021. The priority results defined for Denmark&apos;s interaction with UNAIDS are to: 1. Ensuring that UNAIDS&apos; clear focus on human rigthts, including equity and gender equality, is maintained. 2. Ensure that young people, especially young women and adolescent girls, have access to prevention. 3. Continued refom and risk management.</narrative>
  </description>
